-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Per NIST SP 800-111 and PCI DSS Requirement 3.5, TDE encrypts data files at rest transparently, so authorized database users including DBAs see plaintext through normal queries. Column-level encryption encrypts individual field values, meaning even privileged DBAs cannot view plaintext without the application-layer decryption key.
