-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Per NIST IR 8214, homomorphic encryption enables computation on ciphertext, producing encrypted results that, when decrypted, match the output of operations performed on plaintext. This uniquely allows the vendor to run fraud-detection models without accessing raw customer data.
